# How the dashboard parses a bill

The dashboard requests GET /api/wa-bill-text. The Washington adapter captures the official source document and supplies identifiable prior or cited material when it can locate it. The parser indexes the original source, selects evidence nodes, describes provisions and compares aligned versions across six lenses. Origin and verification routing report separate evidence about the source and expected records.

Both the summary and section view render from the same analysis. The source view remains linked to the official document. See [DESIGN.md](DESIGN.md) for layer contracts and [TESTING.md](TESTING.md) for the acceptance fixtures.
